{"id":"019151aa4ba5ed5ac59137cfca4a4150","name":"Co-witnesses sharing one canonical memory each propagate hearsay independently on departure","start":1792910399016,"stop":1792910399017,"duration":1,"status":"passed","fullName":"tests.test_memory_preservation#test_cowitnesses_propagate_independently_on_their_own_departure","historyId":"a15cb69c8603e76be762c787879f350e.d41d8cd98f00b204e9800998ecf8427e","flaky":false,"muted":false,"known":false,"isRetry":false,"labels":[{"name":"epic","value":"Knowledge Graph"},{"name":"feature","value":"Departure memory preservation"},{"name":"story","value":"preserve_departing_npc_memories"},{"name":"parentSuite","value":"tests"},{"name":"suite","value":"test_memory_preservation"},{"name":"host","value":"runnervmtai0g"},{"name":"thread","value":"2210-MainThread"},{"name":"framework","value":"pytest"},{"name":"language","value":"cpython3"},{"name":"package","value":"tests.test_memory_preservation"}],"groupedLabels":{"epic":["Knowledge Graph"],"feature":["Departure memory preservation"],"story":["preserve_departing_npc_memories"],"parentSuite":["tests"],"suite":["test_memory_preservation"],"host":["runnervmtai0g"],"thread":["2210-MainThread"],"framework":["pytest"],"language":["cpython3"],"package":["tests.test_memory_preservation"]},"parameters":[],"links":[],"steps":[],"error":{},"testCase":{"id":"a15cb69c8603e76be762c787879f350e","externalId":"4c78ed4caf46ffa2b48647f63f4f2e57","name":"Co-witnesses sharing one canonical memory each propagate hearsay independently on departure","fullName":"tests.test_memory_preservation#test_cowitnesses_propagate_independently_on_their_own_departure"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>Per-edge idempotency: a shared canonical node must not let the\nfirst departing co-witness mute everyone else's propagation.</p>\n<pre><code>Two co-witnesses share one LOCAL ``PERSONAL_EXPERIENCE`` node —\nthe shape produced by the sub-linear co-witness broadcast in\nLOCAL-scope memory creation. After the first witness leaves the\nscene, the second witness's later departure must still fan a\nfresh hearsay copy out, attributed to *that* witness as\n``told_by``. Locking this catches a regression where the\npropagation tag was stored on the node and the second departure\nbecame a silent no-op.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"9a4a71f7880258f630225ff04ea18446","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"67cb466e43a22d2b8167a60b2adbb0a5","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"6cd01ca194efb63611cbe56b31183ef3","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1587,"categories":[]}